      <li>You have access to the cluster with <code>cluster-admin</code> privileges.</li>
      <li>You have access to the OpenShift Container Platform web console.</li>
      <li>You have installed the cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>Log in to the OpenShift Container Platform web console.</li>
      <li>Verify that the cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift is installed.</li>
